{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"search"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"codecs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"keyword","text":"any"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI15MIDITuningCodecP","text":"MIDITuningCodec"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI10MIDIDeviceV","text":"MIDIDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"codecs","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The codecs to try, in order. Nothing is sent to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device unless the caller asks for it here."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first device found, or "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if there is none."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A device found this way has the codec and the address that worked, but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no model. A reply can’t name a model, because models share formats. Its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"address is the one that was asked, not one from the reply, because a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device can reply on a different channel."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each address waits for the full timeout, so a search of a codec with 16"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"addresses takes 16 timeouts if nothing replies. Use a timeout longer than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a dump takes to arrive, or a late reply could be credited to the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"address."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Asks each address of each codec for a tuning, and returns the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"device that replies with one the codec understands.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIDeviceDiscovery"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/mididevicediscovery\/search(codecs:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIDeviceDiscovery\/search(codecs:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"search","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"codecs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"any","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MIDITuningCodec","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI15MIDITuningCodecP"},{"text":"]) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MIDIDevice","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI10MIDIDeviceV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11IvorConnect19MIDIDeviceDiscoveryV6search6codecs0A4MIDI0C0VSgSayAF15MIDITuningCodec_pG_tYaF","extendedModule":"IvorConnect","modules":[{"name":"IvorConnect"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"search(codecs:)"},"references":{"doc://IvorConnect/documentation/IvorConnect/MIDIDeviceDiscovery":{"title":"MIDIDeviceDiscovery","url":"\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/mididevi